# Template for .env, the place for anything secret this project ever needs
# (API keys, tokens, passwords). To use it, copy it on the server:
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# .env is listed in .gitignore and .dockerignore, so it never reaches GitHub
# and is never copied into a Docker image. Never put secrets in shop.toml or
# the code: everything in shop.toml is shown publicly on the site.
#
# The site needs no settings or secrets at the moment, so nothing is set here
# and .env is optional. To add one later, list its name here without the value
# (for example EXAMPLE_TOKEN=), put the real value in .env, and pass it to the
# container under `environment:` in compose.yaml.
